<div class="container">
<div class="intro">
<h2>Making a Difference, One Step at a Time</h2>
<p>
Bayt al-ʿĀfiyah Foundation is committed to supporting
individuals and communities through humanitarian assistance,
education, and practical support for people facing difficult circumstances.
</p>
</div>
<!-- FLOOD RELIEF -->
<section class="work-section">
<h2>🌊 Flood Relief & Humanitarian Support</h2>
<p>
In 2025, Bayt al-ʿĀfiyah supported a flood-affected village
in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa by providing essential household items
and utensils to families affected by the floods.
</p>
<p style="margin-top:12px;">
Our support reached <strong>12 families</strong>.
While the effort was modest, it reflected our belief that
communities should not have to face difficult times alone.
</p>
<div class="stats">
<div class="stat">
<h3>2025</h3>
<p>Year of humanitarian assistance</p>
</div>
<div class="stat">
<h3>12</h3>
<p>Families supported</p>
</div>
<div class="stat">
<h3>Essential</h3>
<p>Household items & utensils</p>
</div>
</div>
