</span>
</div>
</section>
<!-- EDUCATION -->
<section class="work-section">
<h2>🎓 Education Support for Orphan Students</h2>
<p>
One of Bayt al-ʿĀfiyah's long-term goals is to support
orphan students in continuing their education.
We believe that education can open opportunities,
build independence, and create a stronger future.
</p>
<div class="education-highlight">
<h2>One Student. One Future.</h2>
<p>
At present, Bayt al-ʿĀfiyah is supporting one orphan student
who is approaching the completion of their studies.
</p>
<div class="education-stat">
<strong>1</strong>
<span>Student currently supported</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- COMMUNITY SUPPORT -->
<section class="work-section">
<h2>🤝 Community Support & Assistance</h2>
<p>
Sometimes people do not need a large intervention —
they simply need someone to help when circumstances become difficult.
</p>
<div class="community-box">
<p>
Bayt al-ʿĀfiyah aims to provide practical assistance to individuals
and families facing financial or everyday hardships, including
help with essential items and necessities when possible.
</p>
</div>
</section>
<!-- FUTURE -->
<section class="future">
<h2>🌱 Growing Our Impact</h2>
<p>
Our journey is still beginning. We hope to gradually expand
our ability to support more orphan students, assist more families
in need, and respond to communities facing hardship.
</p>
<p style="margin-top:18px;">
Our goal is simple: to turn compassion into meaningful action
and to make a difference wherever we can.
</p>
</section>
